        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>书单推荐 - 达摩流浪者 / 深时之旅</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f2eef0;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f2eef0;\n    padding: 30px 0 20px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .band {\n    background: #f0cec6;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    margin: 0 48px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .band.light {\n    background: #f7e2e0;\n  }\n  .entry {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 22px 48px 0 48px;\n  }\n  .cover {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 155px;\n    height: 225px;\n    margin-right: 22px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9a9a5;\n    background: #e8e0de;\n    color: #7a6a66;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .text {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n  }\n  .text p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .spacer-1 { height: 26px; }\n  .spacer-2 { height: 30px; }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #9a9298;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin-top: 42px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"band\">《达摩流浪者》</div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"cover placeholder\">[Photo: book cover &quot;达摩流浪者 / THE DHARMA BUMS&quot;, left of text]</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">\n      <p>评分：8.5</p>\n      <p>永远年轻，永远热泪盈眶</p>\n      <p>相信每个理想主义的nfper，每个在庸碌生活中迷茫的人，每个还没被社会总开关控制的人，都会被书中纯净又赤诚的灵魂打动。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer-1\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"band light\">《深时之旅》</div>\n\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"cover placeholder\">[Photo: book cover &quot;深时之旅 / UNDERLAND A Deep Time Journey&quot;, left of text]</div>\n    <div class=\"text\">\n      <p>评分：8.7</p>\n      <p>地下，有另外一个世界！</p>\n      <p>作者以充满灵性的语言，描绘了地下世界一个又一个奇妙的科学现象，神秘的传说和感人的故事。</p>\n      <p>天呐！惊叹，将是你的主旋律</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">分 享 好 书 的 Grit</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
